                                "sense_id": "74e6310b-76d9-334a-b961-c421a6a1be1a",
                                "text": "\"To conclude this portion of our investigation therefore,\" cried Barbican, clearing his throat, and occupying Aldan's right ear,—\"the Moon's surface is a honey combed, perforated, punctured—\"\n\"A fistulous, a rugose, salebrous,—\" cut in the Captain, close on the left.\n—\"And highly cribriform superficies—\" cried Barbican.\n—\"A sieve, a riddle, a colander—\" shouted the Captain."
